msgid "# RFork Guide"
msgstr "# RFork 指南"

msgid ""
"This guide explains how to use **RFork** as a model-loader plugin in **vLLM "
"Ascend**."
msgstr "本指南说明如何在 **vLLM Ascend** 中将 **RFork** 用作模型加载器插件。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid ""
"To enable RFork, pass `--load-format rfork` and provide RFork settings "
"through `--model-loader-extra-config` as a JSON string."
msgstr ""
"要启用 RFork，请传递 `--load-format rfork` 并通过 `--model-loader-extra-config` 以 JSON"
" 字符串形式提供 RFork 设置。"

msgid "### RFork Prerequisites"
msgstr "### RFork 前提条件"

msgid ""
"- Install the runtime dependency `YuanRong TransferEngine` on every RFork instance.\n"
"- Run a planner service that implements the RFork seed protocol. A simple mock planner script is provided at [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr ""
"- 在每个 RFork 实例上安装运行时依赖 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。\n"
"- 运行一个实现 RFork seed 协议的规划器服务。一个简单的模拟规划器脚本位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"

msgid "### Configuration Fields"
msgstr "### 配置字段"

msgid "### How RFork Matches Seeds"
msgstr "### RFork 如何匹配 Seeds"

msgid "### Planner Responsibilities"
msgstr "### 规划器职责"

msgid ""
"The planner treats the seed key as an opaque compatibility identifier. RFork"
" derives it from the model/configuration fingerprint, the structural digest "
"of transferable tensors, and shard topology. A planner should:"
msgstr "规划器将 seed 键视为不透明的兼容性标识符。RFork 根据模型/配置指纹、可传输张量的结构摘要和分片拓扑生成该键。规划器应："

msgid ""
"- Match exact seed keys, track seed availability through heartbeats, and expire stale advertisements.\n"
"- Allocate leases according to seed capacity, accept lease releases, and reclaim abandoned or expired leases.\n"
"- Make seed selection and lease state observable for operations."
msgstr ""
"- 按 seed 键精确匹配，通过心跳跟踪 seed 可用性，并清理过期的 seed 广告。\n"
"- 根据 seed 容量分配租约、接受租约释放，并回收遗留或已过期的租约。\n"
"- 提供 seed 选择和租约状态的可观测信息，便于运维。"

msgid ""
"Lease release is asynchronous. An unresolved release delays advertising the "
"receiver as a seed, but does not block inference. The bundled planner is a "
"functional example, not a production scheduler."
msgstr "租约释放以异步方式进行。尚未解决的释放会延迟将接收端发布为 seed，但不会阻塞推理。随附的规划器是功能示例，并非生产级调度器。"

msgid "### Quantized Models"
msgstr "### 量化模型"

msgid ""
"For quantized models, RFork transfers tensors after Ascend weight post-"
"processing instead of raw checkpoint parameters. The receiver first builds "
"the same post-load tensor layout as the seed, then RFork copies the live NPU"
" tensors used by inference."
msgstr ""
"对于量化模型，RFork 在 Ascend 权重后处理之后传输张量，而不是原始检查点参数。接收方首先构建与 seed 相同的加载后张量布局，然后 "
"RFork 复制推理使用的活跃 NPU 张量。"

msgid ""
"This path handles Ascend quantization changes such as weight transposition, "
"NZ format conversion, packed weights, derived scale tensors, and MLA/SFA "
"runtime tensors such as `W_UV` and `W_UK_T`. Empty tensors that were "
"released during post-processing are not included in the transfer manifest."
msgstr ""
"此路径处理 Ascend 量化更改，例如权重转置、NZ 格式转换、压缩权重、派生缩放张量以及 MLA/SFA 运行时张量（如 `W_UV` 和 "
"`W_UK_T`）。后处理期间释放的空张量不包含在传输清单中。"

msgid "When validating RFork for a quantized model:"
msgstr "验证量化模型的 RFork 时："

msgid "## Supported Models"
msgstr "## 支持的模型"

msgid "Mainstream DeepSeek/Qwen/GLM series are supported."
msgstr "支持主流的 DeepSeek/Qwen/GLM 系列模型。"

msgid "## Performance Considerations"
msgstr "## 性能注意事项"

msgid ""
"RFork indexes tensor address ranges to find backing allocations and uses "
"binary search for memory-coverage checks during registration. Registration "
"still adds seed startup cost, so RFork is most beneficial when later "
"replicas reuse a seed rather than for a single cold start."
msgstr ""
"RFork 为张量地址范围建立索引以查找底层分配，并在注册期间使用二分查找检查内存覆盖情况。注册仍会增加 seed 的启动开销，因此 RFork "
"更适用于后续副本复用 seed，而非单次冷启动。"

msgid ""
"Performance depends on model size, shard topology, NPU tensor layout, "
"TransferEngine registration time, network bandwidth, and the number of "
"concurrent destinations. Compare with the default loader using:"
msgstr ""
"性能取决于模型大小、分片拓扑、NPU 张量布局、TransferEngine 注册时间、网络带宽和并发目标端数量。可使用以下指标与默认加载器进行比较："

msgid ""
"- Time from process start until the service is ready.\n"
"- Registration, metadata, and read timings in the DEBUG `RFork transfer stages` log, plus bytes and throughput in `RFork weight transfer completed` (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG on other ranks).\n"
"- Seed inference latency and storage/host-memory traffic while transfers are active.\n"
"- Seed hit rate, transfer failure rate, and fallback rate."
msgstr ""
"- 从进程启动到服务就绪的耗时。\n"
"- DEBUG 级别 `RFork transfer stages` 日志中的注册、元数据和读取耗时，以及 `RFork weight transfer completed` 中的传输字节数和吞吐量（TP rank 0 为 INFO，其他 rank 为 DEBUG）。\n"
"- 传输期间 seed 的推理延迟以及存储/主机内存流量。\n"
"- seed 命中率、传输失败率和回退率。"

msgid "## Example Commands & Placeholders"
msgstr "## 示例命令与占位符"

msgid "> Replace parts in `<...>` before running."
msgstr "> 运行前替换 `<...>` 中的部分。"

msgid "### 1. Install YuanRong Datasystem"
msgstr "### 1. 安装 YuanRong Datasystem"

msgid "### 2. Start the Planner"
msgstr "### 2. 启动规划器"

msgid ""
"A simple planner implementation is provided at "
"[`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr ""
"一个简单的规划器实现位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"

msgid "### 3. Start vLLM Instances"
msgstr "### 3. 启动 vLLM 实例"

msgid ""
"Use the same RFork startup command for both the first instance and later "
"instances in the same deployment."
msgstr "对同一部署中的第一个实例和后续实例使用相同的 RFork 启动命令。"

msgid "For the first instance, the planner usually has no compatible seed yet, so RFork falls back to the default loader. After loading finishes, the instance can publish a local seed service and report itself to the planner."
msgstr "对于第一个实例，规划器通常还没有兼容的 seed，因此 RFork 会回退到默认加载器。加载完成后，该实例可以发布本地 seed 服务，并向规划器报告自身。"

msgid ""
"For later instances, if the planner can allocate a compatible seed, RFork "
"will try to transfer weights from the existing seed instance before falling "
"back to the default loader."
msgstr "对于后续实例，如果规划器可以分配一个兼容的 seed，RFork 将尝试从现有 seed 实例传输权重，然后再回退到默认加载器。"

msgid "### Placeholder Descriptions"
msgstr "### 占位符说明"

msgid ""
"- `<model_path>`: Model path or model identifier passed to `vllm serve`.\n"
"- `<served_model_name>`: Service name exposed by vLLM.\n"
"- `<planner_ip>`: IP address or hostname of the RFork planner.\n"
"- `<planner_port>`: Listening port of the RFork planner.\n"
"- `<model_url>`: Stable model identity string used to build the RFork seed key.\n"
"- `<deploy_strategy>`: Stable deployment-strategy name used to build the RFork seed key.\n"
"- `<port>`: Serving port of the vLLM instance being started."
msgstr ""
"- `<model_path>`: 传递给 `vllm serve` 的模型路径或模型标识符。\n"
"- `<served_model_name>`: vLLM 暴露的服务名称。\n"
"- `<planner_ip>`: RFork 规划器的 IP 地址或主机名。\n"
"- `<planner_port>`: RFork 规划器的监听端口。\n"
"- `<model_url>`: 用于构建 RFork 种子键的稳定模型标识字符串。\n"
"- `<deploy_strategy>`: 用于构建 RFork 种子键的稳定部署策略名称。\n"
"- `<port>`: 正在启动的 vLLM 实例的服务端口。"

msgid "## Note & Caveats"
msgstr "## 注意事项与提醒"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"RFork is a warm-start weight loading path for vLLM Ascend. Instead of always"
" reading model weights from storage, a new instance can request a compatible"
" **seed** instance from an external planner, then pull weights directly from"
" that seed through `YuanRong TransferEngine`."
msgstr ""
"RFork 是 vLLM Ascend 的一种热启动权重加载路径。新实例无需始终从存储中读取模型权重，而是可以向外部调度器请求一个兼容的 **种子** "
"实例，然后通过 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 直接从该种子实例拉取权重。"

msgid "The RFork loading flow in the current implementation is:"
msgstr "当前实现中的 RFork 加载流程如下："

msgid "## Flowchart"
msgstr "## 流程图"

msgid "## Application Scenarios"
msgstr "## 应用场景"

msgid "| Field Name | Type | Description | Allowed Values / Notes |"
msgstr "| 字段名 | 类型 | 描述 | 允许值 / 备注 |"

msgid ""
"| **model_url** | String | Logical model identifier used to build the RFork "
"seed key. | Required for RFork transfer. Instances that should share seeds "
"must use the same value. |"
msgstr ""
"| **model_url** | 字符串 | 用于构建 RFork 种子键的逻辑模型标识符。 | RFork "
"传输必需。需要共享种子的实例必须使用相同的值。 |"

msgid ""
"| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | String | Deployment strategy identifier "
"used together with `model_url` to build the seed key. | Required for RFork "
"transfer. Instances that should share seeds must use the same value. |"
msgstr ""
"| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | 字符串 | 与 `model_url` 一起用于构建种子键的部署策略标识符。 | "
"RFork 传输必需。需要共享种子的实例必须使用相同的值。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_scheduler_url** | String | Base URL of the planner service used "
"for seed allocation, release, and heartbeat. | Required for planner-based "
"matching. Example: `http://127.0.0.1:1223`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_scheduler_url** | 字符串 | 用于种子分配、释放和心跳的规划器服务的基础 URL。 | "
"基于规划器的匹配必需。示例：`http://127.0.0.1:1223`。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | Number | Timeout for waiting until the local "
"seed HTTP service becomes healthy after startup. | Optional. Default: `5.0`."
" Must be greater than `0`. Invalid values fall back to the default. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | 数字 | 等待本地种子 HTTP 服务在启动后变为健康状态的超时时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`5.0`。必须大于 `0`。无效值将回退为默认值。 |"

msgid ""
"- **Scale-out after a first successful load**: The first instance may still load from storage, but later instances with the same deployment identity can reuse it as a seed and shorten startup time.\n"
"- **Elastic serving clusters**: Because RFork asks a planner for available seeds, it fits clusters where instances are created and reclaimed dynamically.\n"
"- **Topology-sensitive deployments**: RFork derives the seed key from a configuration fingerprint, a structural digest of the built model's transferable tensors, and the shard topology (`tp_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, and an optional `draft` marker), so only structure- and topology-compatible instances are matched together."
msgstr ""
"- **首次成功加载后的横向扩容**：第一个实例仍可能从存储加载，但后续具有相同部署标识的实例可以将其作为种子复用，从而缩短启动时间。\n"
"- **弹性服务集群**：由于 RFork 会向 planner 询问可用的种子，因此适用于实例动态创建和回收的集群。\n"
"- **拓扑敏感型部署**：RFork 从配置指纹、已构建模型可传输张量的结构摘要以及分片拓扑（`tp_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank`，以及可选的 `draft` 标记）派生种子键，因此只有结构和拓扑兼容的实例才会被匹配在一起。"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | Number | HTTP connect/read timeout for "
"planner and seed requests. | Optional. Default: `10.0`. Must be greater than"
" `0`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | Number | planner 和种子请求的 HTTP 连接/读取超时时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`10.0`。必须大于 `0`。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec** | Number | Interval between planner "
"heartbeat reports. | Optional. Default: `30.0`. JSON configuration only. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec** | Number | planner 心跳上报的间隔时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`30.0`。仅支持 JSON 配置。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_max_attempts** | Integer | Fast-attempt count before"
" transient lease-release failures continue at a slower background interval. "
"| Optional. Default: `3`. Permanent planner rejection still stops retries. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_max_attempts** | Integer | "
"在瞬时租约释放失败转为较慢的后台间隔重试之前的快速尝试次数。 | 可选。默认值：`3`。planner 的永久性拒绝仍会停止重试。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec** | Number | Interval between "
"fast lease-release retries. | Optional. Default: `30.0`. JSON configuration "
"only. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec** | Number | 快速租约释放重试之间的间隔时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`30.0`。仅支持 JSON 配置。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | String | Local address used by the seed HTTP "
"service. | Optional. Default: `0.0.0.0`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | String | 种子 HTTP 服务使用的本地地址。 | 可选。默认值：`0.0.0.0`。"
" |"

msgid "| **rfork_seed_port_base** | Integer | Base port for deterministic seed HTTP endpoints. | Optional. Default: `0`, which lets the OS assign a port. For a nonzero base, main and draft models reserve adjacent slots per worker: main uses `base + 2 * global_rank`, draft uses `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`. Ports above `65535` or ports already in use fall back to OS assignment. Keep this range separate from TransferEngine, its HIXL endpoint range, and other service ports. |"
msgstr "| **rfork_seed_port_base** | Integer | 确定性种子 HTTP 端点的基准端口。 | 可选。默认值：`0`，表示由操作系统分配端口。对于非零基准值，主模型和 draft 模型为每个 worker 预留相邻的槽位：主模型使用 `base + 2 * global_rank`，draft 使用 `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`。超过 `65535` 的端口或已被占用的端口会回退到由操作系统分配。请将此端口范围与 TransferEngine、其 HIXL 端点范围以及其他服务端口分开。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | String | Seed address advertised to the "
"planner. | Optional. Automatically detected when unset. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | String | 向 planner 通告的种子地址。 | 可选。未设置时自动检测。"
" |"

msgid ""
"The YuanRong TransferEngine RPC port is not a configuration field: RFork initializes the engine with port `0`, and the\n"
"engine binds and holds an OS-assigned port that RFork reads back via `get_rpc_port()` and publishes as the transfer\n"
"session endpoint. To constrain the engine to a fixed port range (for example, for firewall rules), set YuanRong's\n"
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN` and `YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX` environment variables (both required, valid within `1024-65535` and\n"
"outside the ephemeral range `32768-60999`); invalid values fall back to OS assignment. Keep this range separate from\n"
"the seed HTTP ports and the HIXL endpoint range. The HIXL data-plane endpoints default to base port `22000`\n"
"(`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT`, 100 ports per physical device), which stays clear of Mooncake ADXL's default `20000`-based\n"
"segments on nodes that co-locate both engines."
msgstr ""
"YuanRong TransferEngine 的 RPC 端口不是配置字段：RFork 以端口 `0` "
"初始化该引擎，引擎会绑定并持有一个由操作系统分配的端口，RFork 通过 `get_rpc_port()` "
"读回该端口，并将其发布为传输会话端点。若要将引擎限制在固定的端口范围内（例如用于防火墙规则），请设置 YuanRong 的 "
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN` 和 `YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX` 环境变量（两者均为必需，有效范围在 `1024-65535` "
"内且不处于临时端口范围 `32768-60999`）；无效值会回退到由操作系统分配。请将此端口范围与种子 HTTP 端口和 HIXL "
"端点范围分开。HIXL 数据平面端点默认使用基准端口 `22000`（`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT`，每个物理设备 100 "
"个端口），在同时部署两种引擎的节点上，该范围与 Mooncake ADXL 默认基于 `20000` 的段保持错开。"

msgid ""
"RFork does not match instances by `model_url` alone. The local seed key is "
"derived from three layers:"
msgstr "RFork 并非仅通过 `model_url` 匹配实例。本地种子键由三个层次派生："

msgid ""
"- a **compatibility fingerprint** over value-semantic configuration,\n"
"- a **structural digest** over the built model's transferable tensors, and\n"
"- the **shard topology**: `tp_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, a conditional `sharded_dp_rank`, and an optional `draft` marker."
msgstr ""
"- 基于值语义配置的**兼容性指纹**，\n"
"- 基于已构建模型可传输张量的**结构摘要**，以及\n"
"- **分片拓扑**：`tp_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank`、条件性的 `sharded_dp_rank`，以及可选的 `draft` 标记。"

msgid ""
"The compatibility fingerprint covers configuration that changes tensor "
"*contents* without changing tensor *shapes*: the RFork protocol version, "
"`model_url`, `model_deploy_strategy_name`, the resolved model revision, the "
"checkpoint quantization config digest, the architecture list, RoPE settings,"
" the effective P/D role (`kv_role`), and `mix_placement`."
msgstr ""
"兼容性指纹涵盖那些改变张量*内容*但不改变张量*形状*的配置：RFork "
"协议版本、`model_url`、`model_deploy_strategy_name`、解析后的模型版本、checkpoint "
"量化配置摘要、架构列表、RoPE 设置、生效的 P/D 角色（`kv_role`）以及 `mix_placement`。"

msgid ""
"The structural digest is computed from the same transferable tensor "
"inventory the transfer manifest validates: stable tensor IDs, shapes, "
"dtypes, and NPU formats. Any setting that changes tensor structure is "
"captured automatically, including weight dtype, TP/PP/EP sharding, NZ and "
"fused MC2 layout switches, quantization post-processing, and speculative "
"draft topology."
msgstr ""
"结构摘要基于传输清单所校验的同一份可传输张量清单计算，包括稳定的张量 ID、形状、dtype 和 NPU "
"格式。任何改变张量结构的设置都会被自动捕获，包括权重 dtype、TP/PP/EP 分片、NZ 和融合 MC2 布局开关、量化后处理及投机草稿模型拓扑。"

msgid ""
"Tensor IDs are readable canonical paths such as "
"`layers.0.self_attn.impl.scales[\"w\"]`. Registered parameters and buffers "
"are named first through module registration edges, so their module paths "
"stay canonical even when an implementation object exposes a shorter alias. "
"Remaining tensors take the shortest path through supported tensor "
"attributes, choosing the smallest path when several have the same length. "
"Container keys use typed labels (strings are quoted, while integers, "
"floats, booleans, `None`, dtypes, and tuples of these are tagged; ordinary "
"Enum members use their canonical member names (aliases share that name), "
"while Flag and IntFlag members use their integer values), and collection "
"rejects any other key type, as well as distinct entries of one container "
"that share a label, instead of guessing. IDs do not contain memory addresses and "
"are independent of attribute insertion order. Exact aliases of the same tensor "
"range are deduplicated, while distinct storage views remain separate "
"entries. Seed and receiver must have compatible tensor and alias graphs."
msgstr ""
"张量 ID 是可读的规范路径，例如 `layers.0.self_attn.impl.scales[\"w\"]`。已注册的参数和缓冲区会先通过模块注册边命名，因此即使实现对象暴露了更短的别名，它们的模块路径仍是规范名称。其余张量取经过受支持张量属性的最短路径；长度相同时取路径字典序最小者。容器键使用带类型的标签（字符串加引号，整数、浮点数、布尔值、`None`、dtype 及由它们组成的元组带类型标记；普通 Enum 成员使用其规范成员名（别名共享该名称），Flag 和 IntFlag 成员使用其整数值），其他类型的键，以及同一容器中标签相同的不同条目，都会直接报错而不是猜测标签。ID 不包含内存地址，也不受属性插入顺序影响。同一张量范围的完全相同别名会被去重，不同存储视图仍保留为独立条目。seed 和接收方必须具有兼容的张量及别名关系图。"

msgid ""
"Shard ranks distinguish same-shaped shards: `tp_rank` picks the TP slice, "
"`pp_rank` the pipeline stage, `ep_rank` the expert set (expert weights are "
"same-shaped across EP ranks), and `sharded_dp_rank` the DP position — but "
"only when weight content is actually sharded across the DP dimension. Two "
"deployment forms break DP replication: fine-grained TP "
"(`finegrained_tp_config`) shards selected modules across the DP dimension, "
"and MoE models with `data_parallel_size > 1` shard expert weights across the"
" DP×TP plane — with or without expert parallelism enabled, since with EP off"
" the DP position is the only thing distinguishing same-shaped different-"
"content expert shards. In those cases the DP rank joins the seed key as a "
"shard selector; replicated DP ranks leave it unset and keep sharing one seed"
" pool."
msgstr ""
"分片 rank 用于区分形状相同的分片：`tp_rank` 选择 TP 切片，`pp_rank` 选择流水线阶段，`ep_rank` "
"选择专家集合（专家权重在各 EP rank 之间形状相同），`sharded_dp_rank` 选择 DP 位置——但仅当权重内容确实沿 DP "
"维度分片时才如此。有两种部署形式会打破 DP 复制：细粒度 TP（`finegrained_tp_config`）将选定模块沿 DP 维度分片，以及 "
"`data_parallel_size > 1` 的 MoE 模型将专家权重沿 DP×TP 平面分片——无论是否启用专家并行，因为在 EP 关闭时，DP"
" 位置是区分形状相同但内容不同的专家分片的唯一依据。在这些情况下，DP rank 作为分片选择器加入种子键；复制的 DP rank "
"则不设置它，并继续共享同一个种子池。"

msgid ""
"Because the structural digest exists only after the model is built and its "
"memory is registered, the seed key is computed lazily and logged together "
"with the digest right after registration (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG "
"elsewhere). A seed miss therefore leaves a debuggable trail of the exact key"
" and digest that did not match."
msgstr ""
"由于结构摘要仅在模型构建完成且其内存注册之后才存在，种子键采用惰性计算，并在注册完成后立即与摘要一同记录日志（TP rank 0 上为 INFO，其他为"
" DEBUG）。因此，种子未命中会留下可调试的痕迹，记录下未能匹配的确切键和摘要。"

msgid ""
"This means two instances must agree on model identity, tensor structure, and deployment topology before the planner will treat them as interchangeable seeds.\n"
"The final manifest is still validated before transfer, and RFork falls back rather than copying incompatible tensors."
msgstr ""
"这意味着两个实例必须在模型标识、张量结构和部署拓扑上达成一致，planner 才会将它们视为可互换的种子。\n"
"最终清单在传输前仍会经过校验，RFork 会回退而不是复制不兼容的张量。"

msgid "### Intentional transfer contracts"
msgstr "### 有意设计的传输契约"

msgid ""
"The following behaviors are deliberate RFork protocol choices, not missing\n"
"manifest checks:"
msgstr ""
"以下行为是 RFork 协议有意做出的选择，而不是缺失的\n"
"manifest 检查："

msgid ""
"- **Dense transpose and reshape:** RFork transfers the one continuous byte range\n"
"  covered by a non-overlapping dense tensor. Before the native read, the receiver\n"
"  may replace its tensor metadata with a storage-preserving view of the seed\n"
"  shape. RFork therefore does not require a separate seed/receiver stride-equality\n"
"  check. Compatible instances are expected to construct the same dense byte\n"
"  order through the fingerprinted configuration and the same post-load path;\n"
"  semantic and physical layout digests are diagnostic evidence for that contract.\n"
"  Gapped or overlapping layouts are still rejected. A new layout implementation\n"
"  that changes byte order must update the compatibility descriptor or extend the\n"
"  transfer protocol instead of relying on the existing dense-view contract.\n"
"- **Processed NZ payload length:** RFork intentionally reads exactly\n"
"  `numel * element_size` bytes for each tensor entry, including processed NZ,\n"
"  packed-weight, and derived-scale tensors. Allocation capacity, descriptor-only\n"
"  padding outside the tensor's dense logical range, and adjacent or shared storage\n"
"  are not part of that tensor's payload and are not copied implicitly. A future\n"
"  NPU format that requires bytes outside this range needs explicit manifest and\n"
"  transfer-protocol support; the diagnostic physical-size fields do not silently\n"
"  widen a read."
msgstr ""
"- **稠密转置与 reshape：** RFork 传输由非重叠稠密张量覆盖的一个连续字节范围。\n"
"  在原生读取之前，接收方可以将其张量元数据替换为种子形状的保留存储视图。\n"
"  因此 RFork 不需要单独的种子/接收方 stride 相等性检查。兼容的实例应当\n"
"  通过带指纹的配置和相同的加载后路径构造出相同的稠密字节顺序；\n"
"  语义和物理布局摘要是该契约的诊断证据。\n"
"  带间隙或重叠的布局仍会被拒绝。若新的布局实现改变了字节顺序，\n"
"  必须更新兼容性描述符或扩展传输协议，而不能依赖现有的稠密视图契约。\n"
"- **处理后的 NZ 载荷长度：** RFork 有意为每个张量条目精确读取\n"
"  `numel * element_size` 字节，包括处理后的 NZ、打包权重和派生 scale 张量。\n"
"  分配容量、张量稠密逻辑范围之外的仅描述符填充，以及相邻或共享存储\n"
"  都不属于该张量的载荷，不会被隐式复制。未来若出现需要该范围之外字节的\n"
"  NPU 格式，需要显式的 manifest 和传输协议支持；诊断用的物理大小字段\n"
"  不会静默扩大读取范围。"

msgid ""
"Successful loads log `source=transfer`, `local`, `fallback`, or `shared_target`.\n"
"Successful TP0 weight reads also log transfer elapsed time, bytes, chunks, and\n"
"throughput at INFO; other TP ranks and per-chunk timings remain at DEBUG.\n"
"Every successful registration, receiver-before-read, and final receiver stage\n"
"emits one bounded `RFork tensor layout summary` at INFO per rank. The summary hashes all\n"
"tensor IDs, shapes, strides, dtypes, NPU formats, logical byte counts, storage byte\n"
"capacities, storage offsets, and NPU descriptor element counts into fixed-size\n"
"semantic and physical digests. It also reports aggregate counts and at most\n"
"three representative tensors, preferring storage views or tensors whose NPU\n"
"descriptor size differs from logical `numel`. Match a receiver's `peer_session`\n"
"to the seed's `session`. Digest differences are diagnostic and do not by\n"
"themselves reject a transfer. On checkpoint-layout transfers, compare\n"
"`receiver_before_read` with `receiver_after_post_load` to determine whether the\n"
"post-load hook rebuilt the layout. Processed-layout transfers instead emit\n"
"`receiver_after_transfer_finalize`, because their layout processing happened\n"
"before the read. The summary does not copy tensor data or prove value equality;\n"
"validate output accuracy separately on NPU hardware.\n"
"Set `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` for per-rank registration, metadata, transfer,\n"
"lease-release, and publication timing."
msgstr ""
"成功加载会记录 `source=transfer`、`local`、`fallback` 或 `shared_target`。\n"
"成功的 TP0 权重读取还会在 INFO 级别记录传输耗时、字节数、分块数和\n"
"吞吐量；其他 TP rank 和每个分块的耗时仍保持在 DEBUG 级别。\n"
"每次成功注册、读取前接收方以及最终接收方阶段\n"
"都会在每个 rank 的 INFO 级别输出一条有界的 `RFork tensor layout summary`。该摘要会将所有张量\n"
"ID、形状、stride、dtype、NPU 格式、逻辑字节数、存储字节\n"
"容量、存储偏移和 NPU 描述符元素数量哈希为固定大小的\n"
"语义和物理摘要。它还会报告聚合计数以及至多\n"
"三个代表性张量，优先选择存储视图或 NPU\n"
"描述符大小与逻辑 `numel` 不同的张量。将接收方的 `peer_session`\n"
"与种子的 `session` 匹配。摘要差异是诊断信息，其本身\n"
"不会拒绝传输。在 checkpoint 布局传输中，比较\n"
"`receiver_before_read` 与 `receiver_after_post_load` 以确定\n"
"加载后钩子是否重建了布局。处理后的布局传输则输出\n"
"`receiver_after_transfer_finalize`，因为其布局处理发生在\n"
"读取之前。该摘要不会复制张量数据，也不证明值相等；\n"
"请在 NPU 硬件上单独验证输出准确性。\n"
"设置 `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` 以获取每个 rank 的注册、元数据、传输、\n"
"租约释放和发布时序信息。"

msgid "1. vLLM starts with `--load-format rfork`.\n2. RFork initializes the model structure on the local NPU, prepares the required tensor layout, and registers local weight memory.\n3. RFork builds a **seed key** from the configuration fingerprint, structural digest, and deployment topology, then asks the planner for a compatible seed.\n4. If a seed is returned, RFork fetches its transfer metadata and copies weights into the registered local buffers through `YuanRong TransferEngine`.\n5. If no compatible seed is returned, or RFork setup, seed acquisition, or transfer fails, RFork releases its registered memory and seed service, then falls back to the default loader. Fallback is conditional on that cleanup succeeding: if registered memory or the seed service cannot be released, RFork raises instead of allocating a second model while the old weights are still pinned.\n6. A successfully loaded model can publish a local seed service and send heartbeats to the planner. Publication waits for any source lease to be released."
msgstr "1. 使用 `--load-format rfork` 启动 vLLM。\n2. RFork 在本地 NPU 上初始化模型结构，准备所需的张量布局，并注册本地权重内存。\n3. RFork 根据配置指纹、结构摘要和部署拓扑构造 **seed key**，然后向规划器请求兼容的 seed。\n4. 如果返回了 seed，RFork 会获取其传输元数据，并通过 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 将权重复制到已注册的本地缓冲区。\n5. 如果没有返回兼容的 seed，或 RFork 初始化、seed 获取或传输失败，RFork 会释放已注册内存和 seed 服务，再回退到默认加载器。只有清理成功后才能回退；如果无法释放已注册内存或 seed 服务，RFork 会抛出异常，避免在旧权重仍被固定时分配第二份模型。\n6. 成功加载的模型可以发布本地 seed 服务，并向规划器发送心跳。发布会等待源 seed 的租约释放。"

msgid ""
"- A successful TP0 RFork transfer logs elapsed time, bytes, chunks, and throughput at INFO. Other TP ranks and\n"
"  per-chunk details remain at DEBUG. Seed acquisition that produces no lease — whether because no compatible seed\n"
"  is available or because the planner request or response fails validation — logs\n"
"  `seed acquisition was unsuccessful; loading locally` (INFO on the summary rank, DEBUG elsewhere) and reports\n"
"  `source=local`. A failure during RFork setup or transfer, such as registration, metadata, or weight-read errors, logs `RFork transfer failed`\n"
"  at WARNING and reports `source=fallback`; inspect the planner warning to distinguish a seed miss from an acquisition\n"
"  error."
msgstr ""
"- TP0 上成功的 RFork 传输会在 INFO 级别记录耗时、字节数、分块数和吞吐量；其他 TP rank 以及每个分块的详细耗时记录在 DEBUG 级别。如果 seed 获取没有获得租约（可能是没有可用的兼容 seed，也可能是规划器请求或响应校验失败），会记录 `seed acquisition was unsuccessful; loading locally`（summary rank 为 INFO，其他 rank 为 DEBUG），并报告 `source=local`。在 RFork 初始化或传输期间发生注册、元数据读取或权重读取失败等错误时，会在 WARNING 级别记录 `RFork transfer failed`，并报告 `source=fallback`；应结合规划器警告区分 seed 未命中和获取错误。"

msgid "- RFork requires `YuanRong TransferEngine` at runtime. If the package is missing, RFork cannot initialize the transfer backend.\n- A worker that is advertised as an RFork seed binds a seed HTTP listening port. With the default\n  `rfork_seed_port_base=0`, the OS assigns the port. A nonzero base reserves adjacent main and draft slots for each\n  worker; an occupied slot or a resolved port above `65535` falls back to OS assignment. Keep seed HTTP ports\n  separate from the vLLM serving port, TransferEngine RPC port, and HIXL endpoint range.\n- RFork transfer is bypassed entirely — the model loads through the default loader and no seed is advertised — under any of the configurations below. RFork registers live NPU weight memory and serves it to other instances, so it cannot be used when that memory may later be released or rewritten, nor when expert placement is not fixed at load time. The bypass is decided before any session or TransferEngine setup and is logged as `RFork transfer is disabled when <reason> is enabled; using the default model loader.`\n    - **Sleep mode** (`enable_sleep_mode` on either the model config or `vllm_config.model_config`), because sleeping discards and reallocates weight storage.\n    - **Online weight transfer** (`weight_transfer_config` is set), because weights can be replaced after loading.\n    - **Static expert placement** (`eplb_config.expert_map_path` is set), because the placement map is applied outside the transferred tensor set.\n    - **Dynamic EPLB**, because expert weights and placement can change after the seed service starts. This covers `parallel_config.enable_eplb`, `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb`, and `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path`.\n- Falling back to the default loader requires releasing the RFork seed service and registered memory first. RFork makes at most two cleanup attempts (`FALLBACK_CLEANUP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`, currently 2), with a short backoff before the second attempt, and only then reclaims memory and reruns the default loader. If cleanup still fails, tensor owners remain pinned and RFork raises rather than allocating a second copy of the model; a session that already reached the finalized state raises as well. Both cases abort startup instead of degrading to a slow load.\n- The example [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) is only a simple mock implementation. If you need stronger scheduling, capacity management, or production-grade availability behavior, implement your own planner based on the RFork seed protocol.\n- The planner protocol headers `SEED_REFCNT` and `SEED_RANK` carry no scheduling meaning, but they are not optional on the wire today:\n    - `SEED_REFCNT` is always sent as `0` on advertisement and is ignored for capacity decisions (seed capacity is controlled by planner configuration). A planner must still accept the header.\n    - `SEED_RANK` remains a **required** field. RFork rejects a `/get_seed` response that omits it or carries a negative value, and sends it on every seed advertisement, lease renewal, lease release, and seed removal request. A planner must echo it back on `/get_seed` and accept it on the other routes. What is deprecated is using it for compatibility decisions: it duplicates the `tp_rank` already encoded in the seed key, so a planner must match on the seed key alone and treat `SEED_RANK` as an opaque part of the seed's identity tuple.\n- Each heartbeat verifies that the seed HTTP service remains alive. If the service exits, RFork stops heartbeats and\n  attempts to withdraw the advertisement while leaving the loaded model available for inference.\n- Temporary planner outages do not stop inference. Retryable initial advertisements and lease releases continue in the\n  background, while permanent planner rejections prevent seed promotion. Outage logs are limited to the first failure,\n  periodic summaries, and recovery events.\n- Validate transfer accuracy and the logical-payload contract for newly supported NPU formats on the intended NPU and\n  model combination; CPU tests cannot establish NPU storage correctness. This qualification is required when adding a\n  format, but it is not a runtime requirement to copy allocator or descriptor padding outside a tensor's declared payload."
msgstr "- RFork 运行时需要 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。如果缺少该软件包，RFork 无法初始化传输后端。\n- 被发布为 RFork seed 的 worker 会绑定一个 seed HTTP 监听端口。默认 `rfork_seed_port_base=0` 时由操作系统分配端口。设置非零基端口时，每个 worker 会为主模型和 draft 模型预留相邻端口；如果端口已被占用，或计算出的端口超过 `65535`，则回退到操作系统分配的端口。seed HTTP 端口应与 vLLM 服务端口、TransferEngine RPC 端口和 HIXL 端点范围分开。\n- 在以下任一配置下，RFork 传输都会被完全旁路：模型通过默认加载器加载，也不会发布 seed。RFork 会注册可变的 NPU 权重内存并为其他实例提供服务，因此当这部分内存之后可能被释放或改写，或专家放置在加载时无法固定时，不能使用 RFork。旁路判断发生在创建 session 或 TransferEngine 之前，日志为 `RFork transfer is disabled when <reason> is enabled; using the default model loader.`\n    - **睡眠模式**（模型配置或 `vllm_config.model_config` 中的 `enable_sleep_mode`），因为睡眠会丢弃并重新分配权重存储。\n    - **在线权重传输**（设置了 `weight_transfer_config`），因为权重可能在加载后被替换。\n    - **静态专家放置**（设置了 `eplb_config.expert_map_path`），因为该放置映射的作用范围在传输张量集合之外。\n    - **动态 EPLB**，因为专家权重和放置位置可能在 seed 服务启动后发生变化。这包括 `parallel_config.enable_eplb`、`eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` 和 `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path`。\n- 回退到默认加载器前，必须先释放 RFork seed 服务和已注册的内存。RFork 最多执行两次清理尝试（`FALLBACK_CLEANUP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`，当前为 2），两次尝试之间会短暂退避，然后才回收内存并重新运行默认加载器。如果清理仍然失败，张量所有者仍被保留，RFork 会抛出异常，拒绝在旧权重仍被固定时分配第二份模型；已经进入 finalized 状态的 session 也会抛出异常。这两种情况都会中止启动，而不会降级为较慢的加载。\n- [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) 只是一个简单的模拟实现。如果需要更强的调度、容量管理或生产级可用性行为，请根据 RFork seed 协议实现自己的规划器。\n- 规划器协议头 `SEED_REFCNT` 和 `SEED_RANK` 不承载调度语义，但目前在协议线上都不是可选字段：\n    - 发布 seed 时 `SEED_REFCNT` 始终发送为 `0`，不会用于容量决策（seed 容量由规划器配置控制）。规划器仍必须接受此请求头。\n    - `SEED_RANK` 仍是**必需**字段。如果 `/get_seed` 响应缺少该字段或其值为负数，RFork 会拒绝该响应；在发布 seed、续租、释放租约和删除 seed 的请求中都会发送该字段。规划器必须在 `/get_seed` 响应中原样返回，并在其他路由中接受它。已弃用的是将其用于兼容性决策：它重复了 seed key 中已经编码的 `tp_rank`，因此规划器应仅按 seed key 匹配，并将 `SEED_RANK` 视为 seed 身份元组中的不透明字段。\n- 每次心跳都会验证 seed HTTP 服务仍在运行。如果服务退出，RFork 会停止发送心跳，并尝试撤销该 seed 广告，同时保持已加载模型可继续推理。\n- 临时的规划器故障不会停止推理。可重试的初始发布和租约释放会在后台继续，永久性的规划器拒绝则会阻止 seed 晋升。故障日志仅记录首次失败、周期性摘要和恢复事件。\n- 对于新支持的 NPU 格式，应在目标 NPU 和模型组合上验证传输准确性及逻辑负载契约；CPU 测试无法证明 NPU 存储的正确性。新增格式时必须进行这项验证，但这不表示运行时需要复制张量声明负载之外的分配器或描述符填充。"

msgid ""
"For processed-layout transfers, RFork reuses the full registration inventory"
" to compute the initial structural digest and reuses the final post-eval "
"layout digest for immediate seed publication. Deferred publication scans "
"the live model again; a structural mismatch prevents publication. "
"Checkpoint-layout processing rebuilds memory registration and the transfer "
"manifest after post-load processing, while retaining the initially bound "
"digest and seed key without a publication-time digest check. This allows "
"compatible post-load reshapes to keep the receiver's original lookup "
"identity. Tensor names, element counts, dtypes, and NPU formats are still "
"validated against the seed manifest before transfer."
msgstr ""
"对于处理后布局的传输，RFork 复用完整的注册张量清单计算初始结构摘要，并复用模型进入 eval 模式后的最终布局摘要立即发布 "
"seed。延迟发布时会再次扫描当前模型；结构不匹配时禁止发布。检查点布局在后处理后重新注册内存并更新传输清单，"
"但保留首次绑定的摘要和 seed 键，不进行发布时的摘要检查。这使兼容的后处理 reshape 能够保留接收端原始查询身份。"
"传输前仍会按照 seed 清单校验张量名称、元素数量、dtype 和 NPU 格式。"
